WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.770
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.580
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.510
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:12.410
Well, well, well.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.420
The Circus Festival will be held soon.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.390
The Circus Festival is a big competition
held every three years

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.520
in which the world's top artists
compete against each other

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.060
doing their really amazing techniques.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.960
Everyone has been training very hard
for this date, betting everything they've got.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.670
Miss Layla won the last competition
with the Golden Phoenix!

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:34.240
In order to be the real Kaleido Star
Miss Layla charged me with becoming,

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.500
I'll fly all the way to where you are.
I'll do it! I'll do it! I'll do it!

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:48.020
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:48.020
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:55.320
<i>Toki ni urahara na kokoro o tayori ni</i>

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:55.320
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.420
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.420
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:56.420 --> 00:01:02.090
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.420 --> 00:01:02.090
New Wings

00:00:56.420 --> 00:01:02.090
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:10.040
<i>Koi ni aimai na kotae wa iranai</i>

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:10.040
<i>There is no place for ambiguous answers in love</i>

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>Arienai genjitsu minai furi shite mo Bet</i>

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>Even while pretending not to see the
impossible reality, we bet</i>

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:23.780
<i>Egatai shinjitsu Can U feel me now?</i>

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:23.780
<i>Hard to obtain truth. Can you feel me now?</i>

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:28.320
<i>Nesshiyasui jibun ni Say What?</i>

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:28.320
<i>Say what to myself who gets excited easily?</i>

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.690
<i>Tomadou iibun</i>

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.690
<i>I'm confused, what to say</i>

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:40.900
<i>Dreamin' samenai yume ochiteku sadame</i>

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:40.900
<i>Dreamin' the never-waking dream,
the falling fate</i>

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:46.670
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' U
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:46.670
<i>Don't stop lovin' can't stop lovin' you
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:56.020
<i>Believe in U hikikae ni subete ushinatte mo</i>

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:56.020
<i>I believe in you even if I lose everything for it</i>

00:01:56.020 --> 00:02:01.550
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' U
No no no</i>

00:01:56.020 --> 00:02:01.550
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' you
No no no</i>

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.160
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.160
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:14.870
Oh, they've announced it, they've announced it!

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:16.400
Oh, really?

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.610
By any chance, I wonder if my name is listed.

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:21.210
Let's me see. Let's me see.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:23.140
If they listed your name,
it would be something else.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.920
Just being nominated here itself is very hard.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.710
Sora... Sora...

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:32.290
It's not listed.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:34.060
Of course not.

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:36.550
My name isn't listed either.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.390
Come to think of it...

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:40.160
May's name hasn't come up either.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.400
It's the International Circus Festival
held once every three years;

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.900
I see they don't have their reputation for nothing.

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:46.200
I heard it was tough to get in, but...

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:49.360
Oh, there's a webpage for the competition
they did three years ago.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.910
Miss Layla and Yuri.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:59.080
They won admirably in this competition
three years ago, didn't they?

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:02.710
And the performance they did
at that time was the Golden Phoenix.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:11.360
Winning at this festival was my dream.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:15.960
I believe this trophy will give me new strength.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.420
The strength to jump higher and farther.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:26.170
Oh... I wish I could say something cool
like that. I wish! I wish!

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:29.480
But, in order to do that,
I have to be in the festival.

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.650
Let's work hard and enter the festival
together three years from now.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:33.980
Yeah.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.980
In order to surpass Miss Layla,

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.420
I want to participate in the Circus Festival too.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:41.520
That's right, this is a part of my dream.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.720
What?

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.890
What is it?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.660
Mr. Leon's name is not listed either.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.490
What?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.660
But with Leon's abilities, he'd definitely
have been chosen...

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:52.900
"Amazing Training With Leon"

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.670
Amazing Training With Leon

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.670
"Amazing Training With Leon"

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.830
Amazing Training With Leon

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:06.940
Come in.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.580
Miss Layla!

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.190
Um, when I was in New York...

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.390
...thank you for all you did for me!

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:18.380
Don't you need to appear on the stage?

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.860
"Salome in Vegas" is suspended.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:25.170
Cathy, the director, caused trouble
with the producer again.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.400
Oh, really?

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.630
Anyway, the reason I came here today is for this.

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.040
What is it?

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.510
Invitations to participate in the Circus Festival.

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:38.780
They're known as Phoenix Tickets.

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.120
Phoenix Tickets?

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:44.320
Since Layla won three years ago,

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:47.320
she has an unconditional "seed" right
to participate in the competition.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:52.630
So she's saying that she wants to
recommend one of you in her place.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:54.260
Recommend...

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.900
You mean one of us can enter the Festival?

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.570
If you're prepared for that.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.500
Yes!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.370
I will absolutely work hard.
So, please recommend me.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.980
Well, I'll work my hardest too!

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.810
What are you going to work hard on?

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:09.740
What...

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.780
The Circus Festival is not just a festival.

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:14.850
It's a place where participants
seriously compete with each other.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:17.550
It's a place where they compete;
win or lose, live or die.

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:21.120
All participants compete,
betting everything they've got.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:25.490
The requirement is not only working hard,
but also the preparedness to win.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.030
Participating in this
with Layla's recommendation

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.600
means you'll be expected to produce
the high-level results that implies.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.740
And as members of Kaleido Stage,

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:37.970
if people see you making a clumsy
performance at the festival

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.740
it will affect the size of our audiences afterwards.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:43.750
Leon...

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:47.120
You decide which of the two it will be.

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:48.340
What?

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:52.050
The trapeze acts have to be performed in pairs.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:56.110
Since you'll be the other half of the pair,
you have the right to choose your own partner.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.430
Who told you I would participate
in something like that?

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:03.260
If you're not ready to definitely win,
you don't have to participate.

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:06.530
If that's the case, I'm the one who's refusing you.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:11.170
I wonder, maybe, if you don't have the
confidence to win in the Circus Festival,

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.310
where you have so many enemies.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.040
What?

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:19.710
I heard there are many on the
selection committee who hate you.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.820
They say the reason why you were not
selected for this event

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:25.850
is because you've ended the careers
of countless partners.

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:27.620
Ended their careers?

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.260
I'm sure there are some committee members
who will want to keep the trophy from you,

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:31.990
even if only out of stubbornness.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:36.100
This is a duel between you and your fate.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:41.040
Participate and win, or run away now.
One or the other.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.000
You're the one who decides, Leon.

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.470
A duel with fate...

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:52.880
Three years ago, I had no choice but to win.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:56.850
And I won my duel with fate.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.820
You ran away then, if I remember.

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:01.590
Ran away, you say?

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:06.490
You'd entered, but you never showed up
at the festival site.

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:08.730
I don't know what reasons you had, but...

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:11.160
It's not that I ran away.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.200
If I'm going to aim for winning,

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.600
whichever one will end up participating,
I'll have to train her more.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.640
That's true.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:20.770
Both of you may be destroyed. You're
prepared to take that chance, I assume?

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:27.440
If they don't satisfy me, I don't care
how many people are destroyed.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:32.180
If they're destroyed, it means they
weren't good enough.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.150
All right.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.290
Wait, Leon.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:40.600
Miss Layla...

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.500
What are you doing?

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.660
The stage is waiting for you. Go.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.000
Yes...

00:07:55.140 --> 00:08:00.150
It seems you already know what
everybody calls Leon.

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:03.990
The God of Death. Right?

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:06.420
So you're doing this, knowing full well
what may come of it...

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:11.690
In order to win in the Circus Festival,
we need that much preparedness.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:16.850
You're the one who taught me that, Kalos.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.270
I believe.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:27.680
I'm sure you're going to choose me.

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:29.280
I'll work hard.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:33.250
I'll work hard so you don't feel ashamed of me
as a partner in the festival.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.180
I will create a chance for you to show off.

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:36.620
What?

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.820
I will create a perfect chance for you
to show off in today's show.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:46.290
Thank you so much. I... I will do my best!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.300
So, as I thought, Leon likes May better...

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:52.060
No... I still should have a chance.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:05.410
Saying he's destroyed countless partners...
I wonder what that meant.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.640
May!

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:29.900
I don't believe this!

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:37.440
Leon!

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:08.180
Are you okay, May?!

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:09.440
What?

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.710
Are you saying I screwed up something?!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:13.820
May...

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:17.310
To think you can't handle a little ad lib like that.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.020
Ad lib...

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:22.390
You don't mean you did it on purpose?!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:25.030
You're terrible! Why would you do
something like that?!

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:29.660
If someone has not reached the level I expect,
that person is going to be destroyed.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.060
It's that simple.

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:33.800
I can't believe...

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:38.040
I see you're not called
the God of Death for nothing.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:39.640
Miss Layla...

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:42.640
The God of Death...

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.280
May, you failed.

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:50.080
Give up on the festival and
heal that shoulder quickly.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:54.580
Because I'm useless...

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:58.690
Because I'm useless...

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:01.760
Did you destroy me because I was an eyesore?

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.090
May...

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:08.690
If you want to blame something,
blame your lack of skills.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:15.410
May!

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:18.380
You shouldn't have time to
worry about somebody else!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.750
Miss Layla...

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.450
If you don't want to be
destroyed by Leon as well,

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:27.250
you should put forth more effort
than you have in the past.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:29.320
Sora...

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:30.260
Yes...

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:33.850
Starting tomorrow, you will have
special training. Be ready.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:55.050
Why... Why...

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.790
I believed...

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:08.520
I believed the whole time, and he...

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:11.700
So, how was May?

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:12.700
It's like we thought.

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:15.740
Apparently the ligament in her
right shoulder is torn.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:19.310
It seems she was told that it would
take a while to heal.

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:21.910
I guess we have to suspend the
performances of Dracula for a while.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:25.610
The God of Death. I heard it before too.

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:29.480
Whoever is paired with Leon
always leaves the stage.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:33.090
Sora, are you sure pairing with Leon
is a good idea after all?

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:37.920
She's right. If Sora is destroyed too,
the Kaleido Stage will...

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:40.900
Sora...

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.230
Where are you going, Sora?

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:02.310
You're going to play Mina Murray.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:11.720
I will create a chance for you to show off.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.730
I will create a perfect chance for you
to show off in today's show.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.710
May...

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:37.490
May... I wonder if she'll be all right.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:43.660
What's wrong? Aren't you happy because
your rival dropped out?

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:45.790
Of course not!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.320
Why not?

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:53.000
May worked so hard playing
Mina Murray as Mr. Leon's partner,

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.340
and then he did something like that to her...

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:59.810
Not only that, if she finds out I'm taking special
training while she's suffering from her injuries,

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.580
I don't know what she'll think of me.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:04.450
Are you worrying about May?

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:08.780
Or are you worried that you might be hated?

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:17.480
As someone aiming to be a real Kaleido Star,
is that so important to be troubled with?

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:25.290
I know. The things I have to do right now
are to participate in the festival and win.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:30.370
Three years ago, I had no choice but to win.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:33.740
And I won my duel with fate.

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:37.110
There's no other path for me, either.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:39.750
In order to surpass Miss Layla...

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.380
In order to be a real Kaleido Star...

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.620
No matter what kind of special training
it is, I'll withstand it.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.250
I WON'T be destroyed.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:59.200
The training that you'll go through
will be very difficult for you.

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.640
I'll withstand it.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.840
Then...

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.410
Until I say you can stop, stand there.

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:05.240
What?

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:07.680
But stand there with only your right foot.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.280
That's all? That's the special training?

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:11.680
That's right.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:15.420
I don't know what the special training for
the legendary great maneuver was like,

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:19.120
but you will find out how easy
that was in comparison.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:21.890
If it gets to be too much for you,
run away whenever you want.

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:23.460
I will not stop you.

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:27.790
I won't run away! I'll show you;
I'll be your partner for sure!

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:38.570
It's almost three hours now.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:41.410
And here I was wondering just how
amazing the special training was...

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.810
But he's just telling her to stand there...

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.310
Isn't this just harassment?

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:50.150
It could be. After all,
Leon is called the God of Death.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.490
Do it one more time from the beginning.

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:01.460
What?!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.630
Ouch...

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.840
What was wrong?

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.970
Don't ask questions.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:16.740
You have only two options: do it or quit.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.770
I'll do it!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.980
Don't switch your foot.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.380
Yes.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:28.390
Today it's the left foot?

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:31.230
What purpose is this going to serve?

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:35.230
Leon is probably trying to hammer
the basics home.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.760
The basics?

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:42.070
If I remember right, you used to say
she lacks the basics.

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:43.500
Yeah.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:48.110
For Sora, standing in the same position
for a long time should be very tough.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:51.170
And that's hindering the range
of her performance.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:56.650
I think Leon sees her weakness and
is trying to correct it.

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:59.450
But, if he overdoes it, he may well
also kill her good points,

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:03.150
Like her flexibility or the muscle power she can
put forth starting from a standstill.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:08.060
You don't think he's just trying to destroy Sora...

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:12.370
Hi, everybody... Looks like we're having
another nice day today, huh?

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:14.830
You don't need to do small talk.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.170
Sora, can you perform at Kids Stage today?

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:21.910
Of... course, I can...

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:24.910
But even yesterday, your timing was off...

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.310
It's because of this special training, isn't it?

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:30.720
Sorry. I'll do my best. So don't worry.

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:34.160
Sora, the more I think about it, the more
I think you should stop this special training.

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:35.460
It's just too much.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:36.890
But...

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:39.230
I'll talk to Leon.

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:40.130
Ken...

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:43.160
In short, you're going to quit now?

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.530
That's faster than I thought.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:49.440
Mr. Leon, I can't allow you to keep doing
things like this anymore.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:52.540
If you want to build up her basics,
I will make a training menu.

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.910
You've nothing to do with this.

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.240
I do. Because, Sora is...

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:59.180
Ken. It's okay.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.920
Sora...

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:04.050
It's okay, I won't lose.

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:07.150
I'll see this through to the end, for sure.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:11.060
I will not let him say that the special training
for the legendary great maneuver was easy.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:28.380
Isn't she the girl from Kaleido Stage?

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:31.550
I wonder if she made some kind of mistake,
and is being punished.

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:34.010
Even if she did, it's just too much.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.250
What is Leon thinking?

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:46.380
It's been more than two hours since she
started standing on one foot on the bus.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.560
Is that really doing anything for Sora?

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:01.710
Go, Sora!

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:14.460
What IS this girl?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.860
She's the first to ever endure this much.

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:27.000
Sagittarius's bow is drawn to its utmost limit.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:33.700
Unless she can shoot an arrow, the bowstring
will snap, and everything will be over.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.910
Ready? Jump!

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:40.670
Smile, smile.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:42.980
Oh!

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:44.310
Oops!

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:48.890
She's reached her limit.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:20:00.130
It must be painful for you to even
stand normally on those legs.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.030
How can you keep smiling?

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:16.340
What... is this?

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:19.520
This...

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:22.220
At this point, this isn't basic training or anything.

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:24.160
I can't think this is for the festival either.

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:28.030
The only way I can see it is that he's just trying
to destroy Sora even if only out of stubbornness.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:35.340
Leon, why are you overreacting so much?

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:38.110
I'm just doing this because it's necessary.

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:40.310
I don't think it is.

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:43.440
It looks like you're afraid of Sora.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:46.840
What are you thinking?

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:51.920
You don't acknowledge May's skills,
yet you chose her as a partner

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:54.720
and you're still at Kaleido Stage. Why?

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.290
What are you seeking from Sora?

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.330
That girl is my dream, you know.

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:03.420
If you destroy her out of petty
stubbornness, I won't forgive you.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.500
Where are you going?

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:14.070
The special training is finished.

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:17.540
You mean, she passed?

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.210
That's right.

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.680
Sora, you passed!

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:22.320
You don't need to do it anymore!

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:22.320
Sora, you passed!

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:22.780
You don't need to do it anymore!

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:22.780
Sora! It's finished! It's finished!

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:24.080
Sora! It's finished! It's finished!

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:27.980
Sora passed?

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:33.190
You did excellent, Sora. You passed.

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:36.130
Passed?

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:37.900
That's right.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:38.970
Really?

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:41.590
Yeah. Congratulations, Sora.

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:43.800
Leon...

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:53.880
No...

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:56.440
I can't stay here anymore.

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:58.390
Hang in there, Sora.

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:00.010
Thanks.

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:02.590
May...

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:03.720
What's wrong?

00:22:03.720 --> 00:22:06.720
Oh, no... It's nothing.

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:10.400
It's fine.

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:13.130
This is fine.

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:20.040
Afraid of her? Me? Impossible.

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:21.310
That's ridiculous.

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:24.940
I can't stand it! I really, really can't stand it!

